                "severity": "SUGGESTION",
                "claim": "Has treats any readable file at the marker path as present, including non-regular entries or content that differs from the marker. ReadFile is bounded by marker length plus one, so an oversized file may return an error rather than false. No test covers a corrupted or foreign marker, so that failure path is unproved.",
