                ]
              }
            ],
            "evidence": [
              "Reviewed both added files in full. Core behaviors are asserted through the public API: absent-before and present-after, isolation per key and per session, 0600 and 0700 modes, the session hash used as the directory name, Has creating nothing, idempotent Add, key validation refusing path traversal without creating a store, a symlinked directory refused with ErrSymlink and nothing written through it, and a relative state home refused.",
